<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>(A)  Operating Performance:  Except for distributions, 1996 information reflects pro forma data assuming the spin-off of ATLANTIC's Homestead Village extended-stay lodging assets (&quot;Homestead Assets&quot;) to a newly formed company, Homestead Village Incorporated (&quot;Homestead&quot;) as of January 1, 1996. Distributions and all 1997 information reflect</p>
<p>	   actual amounts.</p>
<p>(B)  All share and per share amounts reflect the one-for-two reverse stock split that occurred on September 10, 1996.</p>
<p>(C)  In light of the Homestead Village spin-off and ATLANTIC's initial public offering in October 1996, the ATLANTIC Board of Directors adjusted the distribution level for 1997.</p>
